cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the accompanying research paper when using this implementation or its measurements."
title: "PQ-ID v4: Issuance-Bound Credentials with Post-Quantum-Signed Statements"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Kushal
    family-names: Sachdeva
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-5126-0696"
version: "4.0.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research implementation accompanying Auditing and Redesigning a Zero-Knowledge
  Digital Identity System: Issuance-Bound Credentials with Post-Quantum-Signed
  Statements. Includes v4 protocol code, v2/v3 comparison implementations,
  Circom circuits, EVM registries, committed development proof artifacts,
  adversarial tests, measurement harnesses and supplementary revision experiments.
keywords:
  - digital identity
  - post-quantum signatures
  - zero-knowledge proofs
  - verifiable credentials
  - Groth16
  - selective disclosure
